      "description" : {
         "content" : [
            {
               "content" : [
                  {
                     "text" : "template <typename T>\ninline void ObjectVariantMapper::ToObject (const ToObjectMapperType<T>& toObjectMapper, const VariantValue& v, T* into) const\n{\n    RequireNotNull (into);\n    RequireNotNull (toObjectMapper);\n    // LOGICALLY require but cannot compare == on std::function! Require (toObjectMapper  == ToObjectMapper<T> ());  // pass it in as optimization, but not change of semantics\n    toObjectMapper (*this, v, into);\n}\n\nIdea is to ELIMIANTE the need for T to be default constructible. I THINK that fixes the problem.\nBREAKING change (slightly) - so be careful adn do as part of v3.",
                     "type" : "text"
                  }
               ],
               "type" : "codeBlock"
            }
         ],
